WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.400
Offer Check tells you if a job offer really beats what you have now. Here's how to fill it in.

2
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.610
Step one: your current package, top to bottom.

3
00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:12.101
Base salary, employer pension, and your typical bonus.

4
00:00:12.551 --> 00:00:14.797
How much of that bonus you can rely on.

5
00:00:15.247 --> 00:00:18.203
Then allowances, medical, holiday, and your working week.

6
00:00:18.653 --> 00:00:20.368
Your commute: cost and hours.

7
00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:26.302
Open the pension section to add what you pay in, any matching, and whether it's salary sacrifice.

8
00:00:27.002 --> 00:00:30.524
Step two: ask the recruiter these questions, and note the answers.

9
00:00:30.974 --> 00:00:35.925
There are 18, from the salary band to probation, parental leave and sign-on bonuses.

10
00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:38.812
Get their salary band before you name a number.

11
00:00:39.512 --> 00:00:45.209
Step three: fill in the offer, in the same order. £82,000 base, and a 3% pension.

12
00:00:45.659 --> 00:00:50.035
They'll match another 3% if you pay in. But it isn't salary sacrifice.

13
00:00:50.485 --> 00:00:53.145
If the bonus is only a target, count half of it.

14
00:00:53.595 --> 00:00:58.551
A sign-on bonus goes under one-off payments. It counts in year one, not in the verdict.

15
00:00:59.251 --> 00:01:05.410
Step four: set your decision lines. 10% and 20% are good defaults. Raise them for riskier roles.

16
00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:08.682
Then add where you pay tax, and your student loan plan.

17
00:01:09.382 --> 00:01:13.795
The verdict: break-even. After tax, the offer is only 5% better.

18
00:01:14.245 --> 00:01:21.303
Before tax, it looked like 9%. You'd lose salary sacrifice and four points of pension, and both are worth more than they seem.

19
00:01:21.753 --> 00:01:29.765
Your take-home still rises by £408 a month, and your hourly rate, counting the commute, goes from £28 to £31.

20
00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:34.960
To reach Consider, ask for a base of about £86,900.

21
00:01:35.660 --> 00:01:39.201
Copy summary keeps your numbers and the recruiter's answers together.

22
00:01:39.651 --> 00:01:43.513
Copy link opens your comparison on another device, without your notes.

23
00:01:44.213 --> 00:01:46.735
Offer Check. Know your numbers before you say yes.
